<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:center"><span style="font-weight:bold">Votes Abstaining</span></td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:center"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">86,294,275</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:center"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">8,383,548</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:center"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">648,282</p></td></tr>
</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Adjournment of the Special Meeting was deemed unnecessary because there was a quorum present and there were sufficient votes to adopt and approve the Authorized Shares Proposal and the Reverse Split Proposal at the Special Meeting. </p>
</div></div>



